<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xml:lang="zh-CN"><voice name="zh-CN-Xiaoxiao:DragonHDFlashLatestNeural">如果 <lang xml:lang="en-US"><phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="piː">P</phoneme></lang> 在线段<phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="shang 4">上</phoneme>。<break time="200ms"/><phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="heng 2 zuo 4 biao 1">横坐标</phoneme>又严<phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="ge 2">格</phoneme><phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="jia 1 zai 4">夹在</phoneme>两端<phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="zhi 1 jian 1">之间</phoneme>。<break time="200ms"/>就叫严<phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="ge 2">格</phoneme><phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="chuan 1 guo 4">穿过</phoneme>者。<break time="400ms"/>本例是 <lang xml:lang="en-US"><phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="siː">C</phoneme></lang> <phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="he 2">和</phoneme> <lang xml:lang="en-US">dee</lang>。<break time="200ms"/>两<phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="ce 4">侧</phoneme><phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="dou 1">都</phoneme>存在。<break time="400ms"/>非零<phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="qie 3">且</phoneme><phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="bu 2 shu 4 zhi 2">不竖直</phoneme>保证两端<phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="heng 2 zuo 4 biao 1">横坐标</phoneme><phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="bu 4">不</phoneme><phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="tong 2">同</phoneme>。<break time="200ms"/><phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="suo 2 yi 3">所以</phoneme><phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="san 1">三</phoneme><phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="zhong 3">种</phoneme><phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="jue 2 se 4">角色</phoneme>互<phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="bu 2 hun 4 xiao 2">不混淆</phoneme>。<break time="200ms"/><phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="dang 1 qian 2">当前</phoneme>四份<phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="dou 1">都</phoneme><phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="can 1 jia 1">参加</phoneme>。<break time="200ms"/>右<phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="ce 4">侧</phoneme><phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="zhi 2 bao 3 liu 2">只保留</phoneme>输入 <lang xml:lang="en-US"><phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="biː">B</phoneme></lang>、输入 <lang xml:lang="en-US"><phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="siː">C</phoneme></lang> <phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="he 2">和</phoneme>输入 <lang xml:lang="en-US">dee</lang> <phoneme alphabet="sapi" ph="zhe 4">这</phoneme>三份。<break time="400ms"/></voice></speak>
